        </mxCell>
        <object id="nginx" label="03  nginx :80&#10;TLS listener: cấu hình" tooltip="Reverse proxy. Brief specifies port 80 and SSL termination; TLS listener/certificate is unspecified. HTTP :80 itself does not terminate TLS." provenance="User architecture brief; design view, not runtime verification">
